; Source: HSPICE User Guide: Basic Simulation and Analysis, H-2013.03,
; chapter 10, "Defining Tabular Data", "Periodic Tabular Data": PERIOD sets
; 10 ns between successive rows, which omit their times.
RADIX 1111 1111
VNAME A B C D E F G H
IO IIII IIII
TUNIT ns
PERIOD 10
; start of vector data section
1000 1000
1100 1100
1010 1001
